<title>USA: Vanguard Cellular names chairman.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Cellular names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc. said Friday it named Haynes Griffin, previously president and chief executive officer, as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>It also named Stephen Leeolou, previously executive vice president and chief operating officer, as president.</p>
<p>Griffin and Leeolou will jointly occupy the new office of the chief executive.</p>
<p>Griffin will replace Stuart Richardson, who is stepping down as chairman, but will be vice chairman of the board and chairman of the executive committee.</p>
</text>
